From: daveey <daveey@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 06:34:27 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] Bound observation follower waits and coalesce
 failure retries

PR #1884 follow-up: keep observe public signature thin, retry failed flights through normal election, and fall back independently after 30 seconds. Preserve leader finally signalling and generation fencing. Replace handwritten test polling with wait_until.

Proof: both regression tests failed before implementation (unbounded wait and six persists for five followers); 162 tests across all 14 importing test files pass afterward. scripts/check --base origin/main: 21 checks OK. Timeout test expires the real flight event deterministically; failed-leader test holds retry publication until all followers have chosen a path.
